{"unit_id":"vlln__dsh-loop#card-zh","repo":"vlln/dsh-loop","commit":"affdc5fe7e67aff4480dca3e713296ceadfde0e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"loop 是面向 DSH Web 的定时循环插件，通过 /loop 命令和 loop 模型工具按指定间隔向当前 agent 重复投递 prompt，并支持同一会话运行多个循环。用户可以列出或停止循环，模型也可启动、查看和停止任务；对话输入框上方的状态条展示活动循环。设置页可单独关闭模型工具。适合定时轮询、看护 PR 或重复推进构建修复任务；循环状态只保存在当前 harness 进程，退出后清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:185-234","src/index.mjs:337-369","src/client/index.tsx:352-367"]}
{"unit_id":"vlln__dsh-loop#card-en","repo":"vlln/dsh-loop","commit":"affdc5fe7e67aff4480dca3e713296ceadfde0e5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"loop is a DSH Web plugin for recurring prompts. Use /loop or its model tool to start and stop multiple scheduled loops for the current agent; the chat status bar shows active loops. The settings page can disable the model tool. Loops exist only in the current process.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:185-234","src/index.mjs:337-369","src/client/index.tsx:352-367"]}
